# iCoDer runtime state (regenerated on every test run)
# Keeps agent registry + m2a trace store out of source control.
# Originally tracked (commits prior to Phase D) — preserved on disk
# via `git rm --cached` (D cleanup 2026-06-26).
backend/.icoder/

# MedCodER retrieval assets (rebuilt by scripts/build_medcoder_index.py)
# Keep README and build scripts, but ignore the heavy binary outputs.
